do_1 = "Replace the obsolete hosted-read routing descriptions in sdk/wallet/README.md:180 and docs/system/sdk.md:60 with the sentence `px_` reads go to the node root; only `px_register` and `px_requestFunds` require `hostedUrl`. Explain that EndpointClient.batch uses the same split, including px_getReceiptKeys among node reads, and align the surrounding account-read descriptions with sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:66, sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:82 and sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:86; the legacy read-labelled error at sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:62 is reached only by batches containing either hosted operation, not by read-only batches."
do_2 = "Replace the obsolete adapter limitation in contracts/platform-middleware.md:40 with the sentence `HostedGatewayRpc` posts to the gateway root and rejects `/rpc` endpoints. Align the surrounding discovery wording with services/platform/middleware/seller/src/rpc.ts:91 and the root-path assertions in services/platform/middleware/seller/test/repair-22-31-591.test.mjs:48; retain the distinction between the configured hosted gateway and the node endpoint."
do_3 = "Run the focused documentation grep assertions in verify_cmd: require the corrected read-routing sentence separately in both SDK documents, require the root-path sentence in the middleware contract, and reject the obsolete routing and compatibility assertions across those three files."
