[req.181799]
title = "SDK and middleware documentation describes the implemented node and hosted routing"
ac_1 = "Given the read methods and exact hosted-method predicate at sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:82 and sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:86, when a caller reads sdk/wallet/README.md:180 or docs/system/sdk.md:60, then both documents state that px_ reads, including px_getReceiptKeys, go to the node root and only px_register and px_requestFunds require hostedUrl, with batch routing following the same split."
ac_2 = "Given the root endpoint required by services/platform/middleware/seller/src/rpc.ts:91 and the retired-path refusal asserted at services/platform/middleware/seller/test/repair-22-31-591.test.mjs:56, when a caller reads contracts/platform-middleware.md:40, then the contract states that HostedGatewayRpc posts to the configured gateway root and rejects /rpc endpoints without describing an obsolete compatibility limitation."

